# Local HTTPS dev server artefacts.
#
# cert.pem and key.pem contain a PRIVATE KEY generated by serve.py for local
# testing over https://localhost. They must never be committed or published.
# serve.py regenerates them on demand, so excluding them loses nothing.
cert.pem
key.pem
*.pem
*.key

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
